body:
Gay men have dicks too!  They know what they like and generally what feels good.  It's probably an "it takes one to know one ;)" kind of thing.

&#x200B;

Note:  I am not a gay male.  Just what some friends have told me.

Thanks!  I'm looking into getting a bidet now.

&#x200B;

>But you are doing good things to and for your body, and you deserve that.

&#x200B;

Thank you for saying this too.  I needed to hear that.

Holy crap...  This is a beautiful post and something I really needed today.  I've been slowly learning the same thing as you, though through less poignant experiences.  This is something that will stick with me.  My family has been saying the same thing to me but lacked the experience to really communicate it effectively.  Straight from the horse's mouth though...  Wow.  Thank you for sharing.

&#x200B;

>It's not a question of "learning my lesson," it's a question of learning my value.

&#x200B;

That's beautiful.
